
#############
#############
For GMAP
#############
#############

For CASSIM_ISBA=OI
##################
Please note that to activate snow assimilation for OI assimilation
in oi_cacsts.F90 this namelist flag needs to be activated:

NAM_ASSIM
   LRELCLIMSNOW=.T.






#############
#############
For HIRLAM
#############
#############

For CASSIM_ISBA=OI
##################
Please note that an additional namelist variable is needed (same as NECHGU):
NECHGXFU : coefficient for OI & number of hours separating 2 observation times

NAM_NACVEG
    NECHGXFU=


